      "spec_ids": [
        "A-BODY-001",
        "A-BODY-002"
      ],
      "status": "normative",
      "summary": "A named act body is delimited by singular זה דבר המעשה אשר שמו NAME ... עד הנה דבר המעשה אשר שמו NAME; the explicit names must co-refer and layout has no boundary force."
    },
    {
