        "A-NUM-001",
        "A-NUM-002",
        "A-NUM-003"
      ],
      "status": "normative",
      "summary": "Core v0.1 admits exactly the frozen canonical direct numeral spellings 1..9999 inside המספר אשר הוא NUMERAL; this is a direct-literal admission frontier, not a semantic numeric bound."
    },
    {
